                                "sense_id": "aa78b15c-6f9b-315d-9e23-8b6c1b61206b",
                                "text": "He kept whoever it was waiting while he wiped up the beany mess."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "aa3fb8bf-2493-4cc5-9375-c34f4ac41206",
                                "sense_id": "aa78b15c-6f9b-315d-9e23-8b6c1b61206b",
                                "text": "Some producers even add powdered soymilk or soy flour, but the latter can give an objectionable beany flavor."
